            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "md": "I am pleased to report that the Western Australian court dismissed the Health Department's ETS-based claims against Burswood Casino.",
            "value": "I am pleased to report that the Western Australian court dismissed the Health Department's ETS-based claims against Burswood Casino.",
            "bbox": [
              {
                "h": 46.17,
                "w": 758.99,
                "x": 119.29,
                "y": 562.74,
                "confidence": 0.97,
                "end_index": 131,
                "label": "text",
                "r": null,
                "start_index": 0
              }
            ],
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "md": "Attached is the TIA's Press Release and the court's Reasons for Decision. The court stated its conclusion as follows:",
            "value": "Attached is the TIA's Press Release and the court's Reasons for Decision. The court stated its conclusion as follows:",
            "bbox": [
              {
                "h": 42.15,
                "w": 783.52,
                "x": 119.2,
                "y": 631.95,
                "confidence": 0.97,
                "end_index": 116,
                "label": "text",
                "r": null,
                "start_index": 0
              }
            ],
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "md": "Whilst ETS is annoying and of discomfort to non smokers it has not been proved at the required standard, or at all, in this prosecution, that it is a risk to the health of the employees at the Casino.",
            "value": "Whilst ETS is annoying and of discomfort to non smokers it has not been proved at the required standard, or at all, in this prosecution, that it is a risk to the health of the employees at the Casino.",
            "bbox": [
              {
                "h": 68.72,
                "w": 708.01,
                "x": 192.18,
                "y": 698.62,
                "confidence": 0.98,
                "end_index": 199,
                "label": "text",
                "r": null,
                "start_index": 0
              }
            ],
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "md": "At pages 8-9 of the Reasons, the Court considered but rejected the EPA Risk Assessment's \"conclusion\" on ETS and respiratory illness.",
            "value": "At pages 8-9 of the Reasons, the Court considered but rejected the EPA Risk Assessment's \"conclusion\" on ETS and respiratory illness.",
